# This repo holds compiled build output only, synced from the private `aurelia`
# repo by scripts/sync-demo.sh (Windows, manual) or deploy-demo.yml (Linux CI).
#
# Force LF in the repository regardless of which platform published. Without
# this, git stores whatever line endings the publishing machine happened to
# produce, so Windows and Linux syncs flip the whole file back and forth and
# every publish shows a thousand-line diff instead of the few lines that
# actually changed.
* text=auto eol=lf
